Package: pico-dmx-controller
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Pico DMX
Depends: adduser, php-cli (>= 2:8.1), xdg-utils
Recommends: chromium | chromium-browser | google-chrome-stable, ufw
Description: Browser-based Pico DMX lighting controller
 Pico DMX Controller provides fixture setup, show programming, playback,
 MIDI control, and monitoring for Raspberry Pi Pico 2 W DMX interfaces.
 It runs as a local system service and can optionally serve trusted LAN clients.
